# concepts.src - the concept base, authoring form.
# One concept per line:  gloss | isa | defs
# defs: slot=^value ; part-of=^whole   (^ marks a concept reference)
# The gloss is for people only. compile.rex gives every concept an
# opaque id (C.nnnn) by line order. The reader never reads a gloss.
#
# --- base ---
thing||
event||
relation||
